  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING: new, separate app. Models B-hyve hardware as Hub -> Timer -> Zone devices. Battery, connectivity and Bluetooth signal live on the Timer (one per physical timer); each outlet is a Zone child device with valve/switch control, schedule and a readable lastActivity line. Gen 1 (mesh) and Gen 2 (network topology) hubs are linked to their timers. Installs alongside Orbit Bhyve Controller 1.8.x; see the README for the migration steps.",
